# All optional. The app runs with none of these set: in-memory synthetic
# telemetry + a templated "stub" AI explanation. Copy to .env.local and fill
# in only what you're wiring up. Never commit .env.local.

# --- Supabase (server-side only; set both to switch off the in-memory repo) ---
# SUPABASE_URL=
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY=

# --- AI explanation provider (server-side only; OpenAI takes precedence) ---
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
# GEMINI_MODEL=gemini-2.0-flash

# --- Synthetic data scenario for the in-memory repository ---
# One of: normal | workload-spike | cooling-inefficiency | environmental-stress | unsafe-optimization
# NEXUS_SCENARIO=normal
